		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>j&#039;ai une base appartenant à jean !</p><p>postgres=# CREATE DATABASE dbjean&#160; WITH OWNER = jean ENCODING = &#039;UTF8&#039;&#160; TABLESPACE = pg_default&#160; LC_COLLATE = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; LC_CTYPE = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160;CONNECTION LIMIT = -1;</p><p>mais :</p><p>postgres=# GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, CONNECT&#160; ON DATABASE dbjean TO jean;<br />ERREUR:&#160; droit SELECT invalide pour la base de donnÃ©es</p><p>toujours, merci pour votre aide.</p>]]></content>
